    "Name": "Halide Light",
    "Version": 1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Halide Light uses pale lavender surfaces with deep violet icons and small apricot details. The controls have broad, rounded shapes inspired by the dials and cutouts of film cameras. A matching \"ig\" logo and gently shaded toolbar, gallery, and menus carry the same colors throughout ImageGlass."
